#: ../../bsp-manual/bsp.rst:65
msgid ""
"In addition to BSP layers, the ``meta-yocto-bsp`` layer is part of "
":yocto_git:`meta-yocto </meta-yocto>`. The ``meta-yocto-bsp`` layer "
"maintains several \"reference\" BSPs including the ARM-based Beaglebone "
