#: ../../bsp-manual/bsp.rst:70
msgid ""
"For information on typical BSP development workflow, see the :ref:`bsp-"
"manual/bsp:developing a board support package (bsp)` section. For more "
"information on how to set up a local copy of source files from a Git "
"repository, see the :doc:`/dev-manual/poky-manual-setup` section in the "
